The PDF preview (office mode) bundles pdf.js, unmodified, in
`pdf-viewer.js` (built from `web/packages/ui/src/components/pdf-preview/`):

    pdf.js (pdfjs-dist 6.4.299)
    Copyright Mozilla Foundation and contributors
    Licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0 (the "License");
    you may not use this file except in compliance with the License.
    The License text is in `web/node_modules/pdfjs-dist/LICENSE` and at
    http://www.apache.org/licenses/LICENSE-2.0

The only change made when it is run is textual and happens at run time in the
viewer: its worker is started as a classic script, so its trailing `export`
statement is dropped and `import.meta.url` is replaced (see the comment on
`classicWorker` in `viewer/main.ts`). The pdf.js version is pinned exactly in
`web/packages/ui/package.json`.

